{offset200}{ia1}{offset0}

{arial}Akhenaten Transmission
Message: AKH-312
Operator: Sergeant Barkod

from: {arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}
Kalamata sector






Reports show that Jaffari rebels have drawn out numerous ambushes against Psycho convoys around the Kalamata plateau. Their knowledge of the terrain is a significant advantage against the heavy Psycho tanks. I've received the order to localise these rebels and their hideout in the mountain, and to accomplish this before the Tektons find them and flatten them with their bombers.

So you will be alone on your mission. Wait to find out what it's all about before rejoicing ...

You must get to {arialbld}Fort Sudan{arial} which is very much coveted by the Psychos. 

To the north you will find Karlo Von Tekton who is trying to reorganise at the base of {arialbld}Abou-Affar{arial}. To the south-east, a few miles off the coast is the naval base of {arialbld}Al-Fassir{arial} held by his brother Tankred Von Tekton, his profile is attached here below :


{ia5}
{offset100}{arialbld}Tankred Von Tekton{arial}: 29 years old, single, 2nd son of the Duke Von Tekton, appointed Commander of the Psycho War Navy.
Profile: Taciturn, sadistic, treacherous.
Distinctive feature: Muscular atrophy in his left leg.
Note: Detests his two brothers, from whom he sufferred numerous humiliations since early childhood on account of his handicap.{offset0}



{center}{arialbld}Here are your orders{arial}

1 - Primary objective: To capture the HQ of Abou-Affar so as to acquire their aerial and naval technology, this will be essential for the second part of the mission. 

2 - Using the naval technology acquired from Abou-Affar, develop {arialbld}a shipyard{arial} on the coast so as to produce transport ships which can allow you to land on Tankred's island and then oust him from his base at Al-Fassir.













{center}{device39}












This is our powerful 4-inch gun battery conceived for fixed defence.
You will receive a sapper contingent for fortifying your base with these batteries.





{offset50}Commander of the 1st Schyzo Army of Jaffar

{arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}



